This is a draft template. Copy it to profile.txt, fill it in, then run scripts/set_profile.py to save it.
profile.txt is not committed and the app does not read it. The saved profile lives in the database.
Write only true facts. Do not invent qualifications or experience.
Keep it under 2000 characters. Do not include an address, phone number or email.

